{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"获取调用授权关系接口的调用凭证 Access-Token，用于服务端对 API 请求鉴权。可使用 refresh_token 通过【刷新 Refresh_Token】获取新的 AccessToken，授权码 10 分钟有效期且只能使用一次。\",\"id\":\"oauth2.access_token.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710505596940\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"oauth2.refresh_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710506097679\",\"reason\":\"可使用 refresh_token 通过此接口获取新的 AccessToken\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"刷新 Refresh_Token\"},{\"id\":\"application.account_authorization.apply\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506430648330\",\"reason\":\"获取 Access Token 前需了解应用如何申请账户授权以获取授权码\",\"relation\":\"前置知识\",\"title\":\"应用如何申请账户授权\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答中的返回码和返回信息需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"参考文档\",\"title\":\"【附录-返回码】\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710505596940\",\"title\":\"获取Access Token\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mkRSLzKY\">Access-Token是调用授权关系接口的调用凭证，用于服务端对API请求鉴权。所有接口均通过请求参数中传递的 Access_Token来进行身份认证和鉴权。</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oicJs%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u1dr9j7ls-1d31ogtxl1eo00%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22l19a1dmf4-2796tyx6vtus00%5C%22%3EAccess_Token%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%BA24%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8refresh_token%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1696710506097679%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E5%88%B7%E6%96%B0Refresh_Token%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84AccessToken%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1d31ogtxl1eo00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2796tyx6vtus00\">Access_Token有效期为24小时，可使用refresh_token通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710506097679\">刷新Refresh_Token</a>】获取新的AccessToken</li></ul></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201758433146581000%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-SAQ8KGUZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-SAQ8KGUZ\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-iXdBuHFh\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cm15PaD7\" id=\"h346b9f0-cm15PaD7\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-UALxgnFl\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cN4JOhO2\" id=\"h346b9f0-cN4JOhO2\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wib1gtdB\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-dtC8idms\" id=\"h346b9f0-dtC8idms\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qOomvIjM\">开发者应用ID</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MpTdr4jR\">可在开发者后台-应用管理处查看</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">appid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A8kGmfXI\">兼容老字段，待下线</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">secret</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wjWs2C0j\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开发者应用的私钥Secret</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Oz06Vqp9\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">应用管理页面选择应用编辑即可进入查看到应用详情信息</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-WdiViZKC\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"><strong>注意：</strong>填入secret与app_id需对应，否则将会报错</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_code</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4S4dTu6q\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">授权码，在授权完成后回调时会提供该授权码，</span><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">授权介绍可参考：【</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506430648330\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">应用如何申请账户授权</span></a><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">】</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5xDDwDit\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"><strong>注意：</strong>10分钟有效期，且只能使用一次</span></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6yEA5HId\" id=\"h346b9f0-6yEA5HId\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Faccess_token%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH)%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Content-Type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fjson%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%